<title>FINLAND: M-Serla up on strong dlr ahead H1 results.</title>
<headline>M-Serla up on strong dlr ahead H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish forest industry group Metsa-Serla Oy rose on Wednesday on the back of the strong dollar and ahead of its first-half results due on Thursday at 1000/0700 GMT, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1605/1305 GMT, Metsa-Serla traded at 47.80 markka, up 1.40 markka or 3.02 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;It will not go above 48.00 markka today, and tomorrow there will be a new game,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>Expectations were running high after Sweden's Stora reported above-forecast H1 results on Tuesday, brokers said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 248</p>
